  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "This elevated home on 613m² has sea views from every upstairs room and a legal, self-contained income flat downstairs. It's priced way below CV and a full building report is available, so buyers can move with confidence.\r\n\r\nUpstairs – your home\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, living and dining with sweeping Hauraki Gulf views\r\n• Master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Two more bedrooms and a family bathroom\r\n• Separate laundry\r\n\r\nDownstairs – your income\r\n• Legal, fully self-contained unit with its own private entrance\r\n• Open-plan lounge and kitchen, plus a bedroom and bathroom\r\n• Suits rental income, extended family or a teenager's retreat\r\n\r\nWhy it stacks up:\r\n• Asking $1,698,000, CV 2.375mil\r\n• 300m²+ floor area on 613m² Freehold land\r\n• Legal Home & Income with a separate entrance\r\n• Sea views from every upstairs room\r\n• Full building report available\r\n• Double garage and generous off-street parking\r\n• Zoned for Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College\r\n• Minutes from Freyberg Park, the beach, and Browns Bay shops and supermarkets\r\n\r\nBig space, sea views and income, all at a price below CV. This one won't last, so call Bob or Becky today to get the building report and book a viewing.",
